    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Ideally located in the heart of the town centre, this well-positioned first-floor two-bedroom apartment offers convenient living within walking distance of cafés, shops, local amenities and scenic river walks.\n\nCastlehill Apartments is a small apartment block fronting onto a busy street, the property enjoys excellent accessibility and a highly central setting.\n\nThe accommodation comprises two bedrooms, one bathroom, a kitchen, and a spacious dining/living room, providing a practical layout suited to a variety of buyers.\n\nThis apartment presents an excellent opportunity for investors seeking a centrally located rental property, downsizers looking for a low-maintenance home close to services, or families with a student attending the Carlow SETU campus. \n\nWith its town-centre location and strong convenience factor, this property is sure to appeal to a broad range of purchasers."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Notice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Town centre location </li><li> All amenities are within walking distance - cafes, bars, shops </li><li> The wonderful River walk & town park is a wonderful asset close by </li><li> Positioned on the 1st floor - very small block of apartments </li><li> Good management company </li><li> Internally offers two bedrooms, bathroom, kitchen, living room / dining </li><li> Bright airy apartment facing south </li><li> Can avail of parking permit to park in town car park</li></ul>"
      },
